  "body": "15-17 McCrystal Avenue, Eastern Beach\r\n\r\nTarget Completion: Early February 2027\r\n\r\nElevated Coastal Living in Auckland's Premier School Zone\r\nUnlock the ultimate coastal lifestyle in one of Eastern Beach's most prestigious avenues! This boutique development of 10 modern SSTANDALONE residences combines architectural elegance, sweeping water views, and ultimate flexibility-all backed by an elite educational precinct.\r\n\r\nACT FAST: Take advantage of limited-time presale pricing before public release. Secure early-bird pricing and early position on site choice before completion in early February.\r\n\r\nPREMIUM HOME SPECIFICATIONS & HIGHLIGHTS\r\n* Elite Appliance Package: Kitchens fitted with luxury Bosch Series 6 integrated appliances.\r\n\r\n* 10-Year Stanford Building Warranty: Complete peace of mind for structural longevity and build quality.\r\n\r\n* Triple School Zone Prestige: In-zone for Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate (BBI), and Bucklands Beach Primary School.\r\n\r\n* Designed for Flexibility: Flexible layouts featuring dedicated self-contained areas-perfect for multi-generational living, independent teens, boarders, or home-office setups.\r\n\r\nLOT AVAILABILITY & FLOORPLAN OVERVIEW\r\n1. The Ultimate Multi-Generational Flagship (Lots 9 & 10)\r\nLayout: 5 Bedrooms | 3.5 Bathrooms | Single Internal Garage + 1 Extra Car Park\r\n\r\nFeatures: Full coastal seaviews.\r\n\r\nBonus Granny Flat: Ground level features a fully self-contained unit with 2 bedrooms, full bathroom, and kitchenette. Ideal for extended family, live-in parents, teens seeking privacy, or rental income to offset your mortgage.\r\n\r\n2. The Prime Seaview Collection (Lots 7 & 8)\r\nLot 7: 4 Bedrooms | 2.5 Bathrooms | Single Garage - Sweeping Ocean Views\r\n\r\nLot 8: 4 Bedrooms | 3.5 Bathrooms | Single Garage - Panoramic Water Views\r\n\r\nFeatures: Premier positioning within the block, offering some of the clearest, elevated coastal vistas available.\r\n\r\n3. The Coastal View Residences (Lots 1, 2 & 6)\r\nLots 1 & 2: 4 Bedrooms | 3.5 Bathrooms | Single Garage - Full Seaviews\r\n\r\nLot 6: 4 Bedrooms | 3.5 Bathrooms | Single Garage - Elevated, Fairly Good Seaviews\r\n\r\n4. The Lifestyle Entry Collection (Lots 3, 4 & 5)\r\nLayout: 4 Bedrooms | 3.5 Bathrooms | Single Garage\r\n\r\nFeatures: Smartly configured, low-maintenance Executive living offering entry-level pricing into Eastern Beach with subtle water glimpses.\r\n\r\nWHY BUY PRESALE TODAY?\r\nExclusive Presale Discount: Secure today's off-plan pricing before construction finishes and market values appreciate at handover.\r\n\r\nFirst Choice of Layout: Pick the orientation, view line, and bedroom configuration that best suits your family dynamics.\r\n\r\nMove-in Ready by Early Feb: Plan your start to the school year with zero stress-move directly into a brand-new home zoned for Macleans College.\r\n\r\nUnits in this zone move quickly-the top units will sell out first.\r\n\r\nContact us immediately for full architectural plans, finish schedules, and to lock in your presale pricing today!",
